<title>NEW ZEALAND: Owens reports flat year net profit.</title>
<headline>Owens reports flat year net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  9.14 vs 9.14</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 14.4 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  6.0 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				   389.7 vs 399.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     13.3 vs 13.2</p>
<p>    Tax					    4.1 vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Minorities			   debit 0.5 vs 0.3 debit</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			    0.4 vs 0.7</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	    63 vs 57</p>
<p>Note - Owens Group Ltd is an Australasian freight company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
